        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_038\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 151,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你想去哪？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你想去哪？"
    },
    {
        "id": 152,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_038\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 153,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]  整合运动指挥官操纵的新型感染者，很可能会阻碍全盘战略的实施。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "整合运动指挥官操纵的新型感染者，很可能会阻碍全盘战略的实施。"
    },
    {
        "id": 154,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]  我们会为近卫局快速消除他们的威胁，请迅速歼灭整合运动的主要部队。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "我们会为近卫局快速消除他们的威胁，请迅速歼灭整合运动的主要部队。"
    },
    {
        "id": 155,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]  如果近卫局想要实现原本的战略目标，就该把眼光放在自己的职责上。做好你们该做的事。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "如果近卫局想要实现原本的战略目标，就该把眼光放在自己的职责上。做好你们该做的事。"
    },
    {
        "id": 156,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_038\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 157,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  等下！你想就这样离开？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "等下！你想就这样离开？"
    },
    {
        "id": 158,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  想来就来，想走就走？！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "想来就来，想走就走？！"
    },
    {
        "id": 159,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_038\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]  陈警司，提醒你一句。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "陈警司，提醒你一句。"
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]  不要对这里发生的事情追根究底。我只是看在魏公的面子上，不和你再多做计较。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "不要对这里发生的事情追根究底。我只是看在魏公的面子上，不和你再多做计较。"
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_038\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  ——！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "——！"
    },
    {
        "id": 164,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_038\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
